{%- comment -%}
  Tiered savings bar.

  Layout is deliberate: the reward sits directly above its node and the
  threshold directly below it, both centred on the same percentage, so the eye
  reads "₹100 off at ₹999" as one column rather than matching two loose rows.

  The rail is inset inside the padded scale so the first and last labels have
  room to centre without spilling out of the card.

  IMPORTANT — this bar displays progress. It does not itself discount
  anything. Shopify applies only one order-class automatic discount per order,
  so overlapping automatic discounts cannot be relied on to resolve to the
  right tier. Mirror these thresholds with a discount that actually applies at
  checkout, or the cart promises money it does not deliver.

  Accepts:
  - tiers_json: {String} JSON array of { min, off }
  - context: {String} 'drawer' or 'page', for styling only
{%- endcomment -%}

<div
  class="mtier mtier--{{ context | default: 'page' }}"
  data-mastt-tiers
  data-tiers="{{ tiers_json | escape }}"
  data-total="{{ cart.total_price }}"
>
  <p class="mtier__msg" data-mtier-msg aria-live="polite"></p>

  <div class="mtier__scale">
    <div class="mtier__rail">
      <div class="mtier__above" data-mtier-above aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="mtier__track">
        <span class="mtier__fill" data-mtier-fill></span>
        <span class="mtier__nodes" data-mtier-nodes aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </div>

      <div class="mtier__below" data-mtier-below aria-hidden="true"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <span class="mtier__burst" data-mtier-burst aria-hidden="true"></span>
</div>
